          "The hazard rate $h(t)$ represents the instantaneous rate of fill conditioned on the order surviving unfilled up to time $t$.",
          "In limit order book queues, fill probability decays exponentially with the volume of orders sitting ahead in the queue: $P(Fill | Q_{ahead}) = e^{-\\beta \\cdot Q_{ahead} / \\bar{V}}$.",
